{"version" 2 "boxes" [{"id" "stigmergy_followers" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root" #afield/box "stigmergy_slime"} "name" "followers" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [680.0 40.0 300.0 100.0] "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "stigmergy_followers_code_.kt" "inline" "/*\nA second particle system that only reads the field. Each particle climbs the gradient\nof dot(trail, weights): up species 0's channel (amber) and down species 1's (cyan), so\nthe white dots gather on amber roads and slide off cyan ones.\n*/\nvar followers = TrailFollowers(physarum.trail) {\n    count = 20_000\n    weights = vec(1f, -1f, 0f, 0f)\n    steering = 0.4f\n    pointSize = 3f\n    // white: the default magenta is too close to the third species' pink\n    color = vec(1f, 1f, 1f, 1f)\n}\n// draws after the trail's preview, so the points sit on top of it\nfollowers.installInto()\nprintln(\"${followers.settings.count} followers on the trail\")\n"}}} {"id" "stigmergy_reset" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root" #afield/box "stigmergy_slime"} "name" "reset" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [340.0 400.0 300.0 100.0] "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "stigmergy_reset_code_.kt" "inline" "// empty the trail, restore the territorial matrices, and scatter the agents again\nphysarum.settings.depositInto = null\nphysarum.settings.attraction = listOf(\n    vec(1f, -2f, -2f, 0f),\n    vec(-2f, 1f, -2f, 0f),\n    vec(-2f, -2f, 1f, 0f),\n)\nphysarum.trail.clear()\nphysarum.resetAgents(System.nanoTime())\nprintln(\"reset\")\n"}}} {"id" "stigmergy_chase" "properties" {"children" #{} "parents" #{#afield/box "root" #afield/box "stigmergy_slime"} "name" "chase" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [340.0 160.0 300.0 100.0] "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "stigmergy_chase_code_.kt" "inline" "/*\nSpecies may write into each other's channels. Here species 1 (cyan) also lays half a\nmark of species 0's scent wherever it goes, and species 0 (amber) is repelled twice as\nhard by cyan as before. Re-run with other numbers: both matrices are read every frame.\n*/\nphysarum.settings.depositInto = listOf(\n    vec(1f, 0f, 0f, 0f),\n    vec(0.5f, 1f, 0f, 0f),\n    vec(0f, 0f, 1f, 0f),\n)\nphysarum.settings.attraction = listOf(\n    vec(1f, -4f, -2f, 0f),\n    vec(1f, 1f, -2f, 0f),\n    vec(-2f, -2f, 1f, 0f),\n)\nprintln(\"chase: species 1 follows species 0 and marks its channel\")\n"}}} {"id" "stigmergy_renderer" "properties" {"children" #{#afield/box "stigmergy_slime"} "parents" #{#afield/box "root"} "name" "renderer" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [40.0 40.0 300.0 100.0] "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "stigmergy_renderer_code_.kt" "inline" "import afield.graphics.vulkan.util.Options\n\nprop<Window>(window)\nprop<Renderer>(renderer)\nOptions.enableHDR = false\nOptions.profiling = false\n// once: re-running this box keeps the existing window and renderer\nonce.renderer {\n    window = Window(\"Stigmergy\", initialDimensions = Rect(80.0, 80.0, 768.0, 768.0))\n    Renderer(window)\n}\nprintln(\"renderer ready\")\n// the frame loop runs as this box's coroutine; stopping the box stops rendering\nstart(renderer::run)\n"}}} {"id" "stigmergy_slime" "properties" {"children" #{#afield/box "stigmergy_followers" #afield/box "stigmergy_chase" #afield/box "stigmergy_reset"} "parents" #{#afield/box "root" #afield/box "stigmergy_renderer"} "name" "three species" "_tombstone" false "frame" #afield/rect [340.0 40.0 300.0 100.0] "code" #afield/file-inline {"path" "stigmergy_slime_code_.kt" "inline" "/*\nThree species on one 1024 x 1024 trail, one channel each. Row s of `attraction` is how\nspecies s weighs the four channels when it senses: +1 for its own, -2 for each other's.\n`exclusive` is Jones' one-agent-per-pixel rule, so no road can hold more agents than it\nhas pixels. Low diffusion keeps the trails sharp. The three pack the field into an\ninterlocking labyrinth whose colours do not cross; one species alone, at the same\ndensity, closes into a net of cells instead.\n*/\nprop<ShaderPhysarumSystem>(physarum) = ShaderPhysarumSystem() {\n    width = 1024\n    height = 1024\n    agentCount = 300_000\n    speciesCount = 3\n    exclusive = true\n    exposure = 0.06f\n    attraction = listOf(\n        vec(1f, -2f, -2f, 0f),\n        vec(-2f, 1f, -2f, 0f),\n        vec(-2f, -2f, 1f, 0f),\n    )\n}\nphysarum.trail.settings.diffusion = 0.2f\n\n// steps once a frame and draws the trail, one colour per species\nphysarum.installInto()\nprintln(\"${physarum.settings.agentCount} agents, ${physarum.settings.speciesCount} species\")\n"}}}] "persistentProperties" ["frame" "name" "code" "code_language" "contents_language" "default_property" "file_proxy_mode" "file_proxy_path" "file_proxy_original_path" "file_proxy_mime" "filename" "preamble" "introduction" "attic" "notes" "geometryReviews" "geometryAppearance" "fragment" "stackSL" "rectSL" "msl" "vertex" "vertex_fragment" "task" "mesh" "raygen" "miss" "closesthit" "anyhit" "intersection" "callable" "fragment_s" "vertex_s" "task_s" "mesh_s" "raygen_s" "miss_s" "closesthit_s" "anyhit_s" "intersection_s" "callable_s" "children" "parents" "compute" "compute_s" "customization" "source_id" "templateId" "_tombstone" "isRemoteJSRoot" "isPythonRoot" ".*_editorState" "metadata" "nested" "nestedIn" "playlist" "pauseList" "bookmarks" "drawing" "panes" "slideShow" "autorun" "layers" "layerFrames" "_controlGroupValues" "_controlMidi" "keyframeData" "keyframeInterpolants" "ai4_auto_name" "ai4_auto_name_signature" "ai4_chat_history" "ai4_chat_running" "ai4_chat_suspension" "ai4_session" "fileManagerAccessHistory" "kitRole"]}